<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SymTorch: A Framework for Symbolic
Distillation 
<br class="ltx_break">of Deep Neural Networks</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Elizabeth S.Z. Tan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
